@ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245

# Cole aqui o accessToken devolvido por POST /login.
@token = <cole-o-access-token>

GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

# Os endpoints do checkpoint estão definidos em docs/REQUISITOS.md.

### Cadastro (nunca aceita role)
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "funcionario@empresa.com",
  "password": "<senha-do-usuario>"
}

### Login
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "funcionario@empresa.com",
  "password": "<senha-do-usuario>"
}

### Criar rascunho (Employee). Proprietario, estado e horarios vem do servidor.
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "description": "Taxi para reuniao com cliente",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### Editar rascunho proprio (somente em Draft)
PUT {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "description": "Taxi ida e volta para reuniao com cliente",
  "amount": 60.00,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### Enviar rascunho (Draft -> Submitted)
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar reembolsos visiveis ao perfil
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar detalhe (fora do escopo de leitura retorna 404)
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
